302 0 obj
  << /ActualText (During my time at Guangzhou Huali College\054 I had the opportunity to intern at the Culture\054 Sports and Tourism Publicity Office and Pi Yi Xia Design Studio\056 These experiences allowed me to see visual design in action\054 collaborating with talented professionals and contributing to real\055world projects such as koi\055themed video production\054 wall painting promotion videos\054 and red cultural IP design\056 I learned invaluable lessons about the creative process\054 from concept development to final execution\054 including skills in video editing\054 poster design\054 and brand visual identity\056\015\n\015\nI thrive in collaborative environments\054 where ideas can bounce and evolve\056 I love the challenge of taking a concept and translating it into a compelling visual experience\056 Whether I\047m producing videos\054 designing posters\054 or developing IP characters\054 I\047m always searching for ways to connect with people on a deeper level through my work\056)
     /K [ 81 ]
     /P 303 0 R
     /Pg 140 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

